orms.",{"mainImage":24,"values":33},{"alt":25,"desktop":26,"mobile":30},"Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry embodying imperfection, freedom and raw natural beauty",{"src":27,"width":28,"height":29},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-values-bg-desktop.jpg",1920,1772,{"src":31,"width":32,"height":28},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-values-bg-mobile.jpg",1080,[34,35,36,37,38],"Imperfection Uniqueness","Freedom Authenticity","Handcraft Transformation","Time Raw Beauty","Fragments Wholeness","Padova",{"abstract1":41,"abstract2":42,"image":43},"I create jewelry by hand, starting from imperfect fragments. I like to think that from a “rough piece” something can be born that enhances the one who wears it, and that even mistakes, over time, turn into uniqueness. For me, working with metals and stones is not just technique: it is a way of taking time for myself, to breathe, to live better.","My journey began as a game, bending iron wires, and grew into study, research, and passion. I taught myself how to set stones, and fell in love with wax and silver—materials that are always with me. Every creation is “in my own way”: authentic, free, imperfect. This is what guides me — creative freedom, handcraft, and the beauty that rises from imperfection.",{"src":44,"alt":45,"width":46,"height":47},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fchiara-potrait.jpg","Chiara Longo, founder and artisan of Indigo, handcrafting jewelry in her Padova studio",1050,1380,{},{"title":50,"subtitle":51,"mainImage":52,"sideImage":57,"abstract":62},"THE SOUND WITHIN","“Every jewel is born in silence, yet carries a sound within. five melodies tell what words cannot say.”",{"src":53,"alt":54,"width":55,"height":56},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fsounds-main-image.jpg","Indigo handmade silver jewelry paired with original sound in The Sound Within",990,1438,{"src":58,"alt":59,"width":60,"height":61},"\u002Fthe-maker\u002Fsounds-side-image.jpg","Detail of Indigo artisan jewelry born from silver, stones and wax",634,884,"Each chapter does not live in shapes alone. I wanted it to have a voice, a breath of sound. Together with Riccardo Rampazzo, we created five melodies, born with the tales, to give the jewels a sense of time and an invisible echo.","modals\u002Fthe-maker","laM-x1EV7Rrt_4Ht77Ulu9mSCzIuEOKhozn3fB8rmiU",[66,181,271,363,449],{"id":67,"title":68,"caption":69,"cover":70,"extension":6,"head":80,"lookbook":99,"meta":110,"outro":111,"productGallery":118,"productOverview":159,"productStory":170,"slug":173,"sounds":174,"stem":179,"__hash__":180},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm.json","Rhythm","A DANCE OF LIGHT AND SHADOW",{"alt":71,"desktop":72,"mobile":75,"thumbnail":77},"Rhythm chapter cover: Indigo handcrafted sterling silver jewelry inspired by nomadic freedom and moonlight",{"src":73,"width":28,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",1600,{"src":76,"width":32,"height":28},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":78,"width":79,"height":79},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",100,{"abstract":81,"heading1":82,"heading2":83,"sideImage1":84,"sideImage2":89,"mainImage":92,"cursorImage":97},"Freedom dancing beyond boundaries. Precious details for those who live by their own rules.","NOMADIC","RHYTHM",{"src":85,"alt":86,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-1.jpg","Editorial detail of Indigo Rhythm sterling silver jewelry, a dance of light and shadow",400,530,{"src":90,"alt":91,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-2.jpg","Model wearing handcrafted Indigo silver jewelry from the nomadic Rhythm tale",{"src":93,"alt":94,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fhead-main.jpg","Indigo Selene silver ring styled in the nomadic Rhythm editorial",1400,1866,{"src":98},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":100,"mainImage":101,"secondaryImage":106,"cursorImage":109},"I dwell in the freedom of movement, in its irregular cadence. I seek an aesthetic that vibrates through the body, sparking a dance without limits. Every rhythm is rebellion, every detail a living presence.",{"src":102,"alt":103,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Flookbook-main.jpg","Rhythm lookbook: Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry vibrating with movement",1150,1540,{"src":107,"alt":108,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg","Rhythm lookbook detail of Indigo sterling silver ring worn on skin",{"src":98},{},{"abstract":112,"image":113},"I've always felt freedom as a nomadic journey: made of boundless roads and details that endure. If something calls to you, I'm here.",{"src":114,"alt":115,"width":116,"height":117},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Foutro-maker.jpg","Chiara Longo, Indigo's maker, closing the Rhythm chapter",934,1204,{"title":119,"gallery":120},"THE COLLECTION",[121,129,135,141,147,153],{"title":122,"image":123,"shopLink":128},"BROKEN HEART RING",{"src":124,"alt":125,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fbroken-heart.jpg","Broken Heart ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo",1610,2148,"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466104667\u002Fbroken-heart-ring",{"title":130,"image":131,"shopLink":134},"PHILOSOPHER RING",{"src":132,"alt":133,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fphilosopher.jpg","Philosopher ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4467057805\u002Fphilosopher-ring",{"title":136,"image":137,"shopLink":140},"SELENE'S ORBIT",{"src":138,"alt":139,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fselenes-orbit.jpg","Selene's Orbit, handcrafted sterling silver 925 jewel by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469769360\u002Fselene-s-orbit",{"title":142,"image":143,"shopLink":146},"SELENE RING",{"src":144,"alt":145,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fselene-ring.jpg","Selene ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 with burnished moon detail by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466077163\u002Fselene-ring",{"title":148,"image":149,"shopLink":152},"AURA EARRINGS",{"src":150,"alt":151,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Faura-earrings.jpg","Aura earrings, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4471340799\u002Faura-earrings",{"title":154,"image":155,"shopLink":158},"CHAINS RING",{"src":156,"alt":157,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-ring.jpg","Chains ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469012462\u002Fchains-ring",{"title":142,"price":160,"mainImage":161,"tags":165},90,{"src":162,"alt":163,"width":28,"height":164},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fring-full.jpg","Indigo Selene ring, handcrafted hand-forged sterling silver 925 with burnished crescent-moon detail",2140,[166,167,168,169],"Sterling Silver 925","Handcrafted, hand-forged","Mirror-polished with burnished details","Adjustable open ring",{"story":171,"crafting":172},"This ring was born from the desire to embody a playful, surprising spirit. Its inspiration is the moon, the ultimate feminine symbol, long associated with life and nature from cycles and fertility to tides and harvests. A magnetic, mysterious force that radiates a vital, untamed energy, capable of transforming everything it touches.","A fully handcrafted ring, made at the bench. The open, adjustable band features two symbolic details: on one side, a hammered and burnished crescent moon that recalls lunar craters; on the other, a polished silver sphere.","rhythm",{"bg":175,"song":177},{"src":176},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fsounds\u002Frhytm-ambient.mp3",{"src":178},"\u002Fchapters\u002F01_rhythm\u002Fsounds\u002Frhytm-song.mp3","chapters\u002F01_rhythm","f9ZDHhqHxmuHFNld2lLm6fU8XHIqnTQaYVxr9_QE7qA",{"id":182,"title":183,"caption":184,"cover":185,"extension":6,"head":193,"lookbook":208,"meta":217,"outro":218,"productGallery":223,"productOverview":251,"productStory":260,"slug":263,"sounds":264,"stem":269,"__hash__":270},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse.json","Pulse","THE BEAUTY OF BECOMING",{"alt":186,"desktop":187,"mobile":189,"thumbnail":191},"Pulse chapter cover: Indigo handcrafted sterling silver jewelry celebrating the beauty of becoming",{"src":188,"width":28,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":190,"width":32,"height":28},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":192,"width":79,"height":79},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":194,"heading1":195,"heading2":196,"sideImage1":197,"sideImage2":200,"mainImage":203,"cursorImage":206},"A beat etched on the skin, a mark that vibrates. Shimmering surfaces stretch silence, turning it into a living presence.","SACRED","PULSE",{"src":198,"alt":199,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-1.jpg","Editorial detail of Indigo Pulse sterling silver jewelry, a beat etched on the skin",{"src":201,"alt":202,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-2.jpg","Model wearing handcrafted Indigo silver jewelry from the sacred Pulse tale",{"src":204,"alt":205,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fhead-main.jpg","Indigo Morph silver ring styled in the sacred Pulse editorial",{"src":207},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":209,"mainImage":210,"secondaryImage":213,"cursorImage":216},"We are born with the urge to break balance and trace new lines. I seek an aesthetic that refuses to conform, that never asks for approval: it speaks through sharp silences and details that become a manifesto. Every gesture is an affirmation, every gaze a boundary redrawn.",{"src":211,"alt":212,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Flookbook-main.jpg","Pulse lookbook: Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry as a nonconforming manifesto",{"src":214,"alt":215,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg","Pulse lookbook detail of Indigo sterling silver ring worn on skin",{"src":207},{},{"abstract":219,"image":220},"I've learned not to fear life's cycles: every transformation is an invitation to be reborn in ways yet unknown. The freedom to express who we are, beyond any form or definition, is a value Indigo embraces.",{"src":221,"alt":222,"width":116,"height":117},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Foutro-maker.jpg","Chiara Longo, Indigo's maker, closing the Pulse chapter",{"title":119,"gallery":224},[225,231,236,242,248],{"title":226,"image":227,"shopLink":230},"COLUMN RING",{"src":228,"alt":229,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fcolumn-ring.jpg","Column ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4468988304\u002Fcolumnn-ring",{"title":232,"image":233},"DELTA",{"src":234,"alt":235,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fdelta.jpg","Delta, handcrafted sterling silver 925 jewel by Indigo",{"title":237,"image":238,"shopLink":241},"LAVA RING",{"src":239,"alt":240,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Flava-ring.jpg","Lava ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466113779\u002Flava-ring",{"title":243,"image":244,"shopLink":247},"MORPH RING",{"src":245,"alt":246,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fmorph-ring.jpg","Morph ring, handcrafted lost-wax cast sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466061633\u002Fmorph-ring",{"title":154,"image":249,"shopLink":158},{"src":250,"alt":157,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-ring.jpg",{"title":243,"price":252,"mainImage":253,"tags":256},110,{"src":254,"alt":255,"width":28,"height":164},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fring-full.jpg","Indigo Morph ring, handcrafted lost-wax cast sterling silver 925 with mirror-polished finish",[166,257,258,259],"Lost-wax casting","Mirror polish","Polished finish",{"story":261,"crafting":262},"This ring was born almost playfully, starting from the form of a realistic beetle that was deliberately deconstructed and transformed into something new. The rigor of the figure was released, giving way to freedom and experimentation, dissolving into a more abstract and spontaneous gesture. A light yet meaningful creative process that speaks of transformation: as in life, what ends does not disappear, but changes form and continues to exist, revealing unexpected beauty.","Handcrafted using the lost-wax technique. Born from an initial model later transformed, it retains traces of its origin in the open, fragmented structure, evoking at once an eye or a void. The irregular surface, etched with lines that seem to melt away, recalls volcanic matter or a process of decomposition—turning what fades into a new kind of beauty.","pulse",{"bg":265,"song":267},{"src":266},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fsounds\u002Fpulse-ambient.mp3",{"src":268},"\u002Fchapters\u002F02_pulse\u002Fsounds\u002Fpulse-song.mp3","chapters\u002F02_pulse","S0gua0m5ttIJpkVijwrMwNsrvMLd8Axcx4rVEGziEdg",{"id":272,"title":273,"caption":274,"cover":275,"extension":6,"head":283,"lookbook":298,"meta":307,"outro":308,"productGallery":313,"productOverview":345,"productStory":352,"slug":355,"sounds":356,"stem":361,"__hash__":362},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper.json","Whisper","A SHARP SIGN, SUSPENDED BETWEEN STABILITY AND TENSION",{"alt":276,"desktop":277,"mobile":279,"thumbnail":281},"Whisper chapter cover: Indigo handcrafted sterling silver jewelry suspended between stability and tension",{"src":278,"width":28,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":280,"width":32,"height":28},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":282,"width":79,"height":79},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":284,"heading1":285,"heading2":286,"sideImage1":287,"sideImage2":290,"mainImage":293,"cursorImage":296},"A whisper brushing the air, a secret gliding lightly through the forest. A silent elegance that exists only in the details.","WHISPERED","SING",{"src":288,"alt":289,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-1.jpg","Editorial detail of Indigo Whisper sterling silver jewelry, a silent elegance in the details",{"src":291,"alt":292,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-2.jpg","Model wearing handcrafted Indigo silver jewelry from the whispered Whisper tale",{"src":294,"alt":295,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fhead-main.jpg","Indigo Axis silver ring styled in the whispered Whisper editorial",{"src":297},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":299,"mainImage":300,"secondaryImage":303,"cursorImage":306},"I choose the strength of what does not shout. An aesthetic that lives in imperceptible details, in fine lines that remain like a hidden trace. Every silence becomes language, every whisper elegance.",{"src":301,"alt":302,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Flookbook-main.jpg","Whisper lookbook: Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry living in imperceptible details",{"src":304,"alt":305,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg","Whisper lookbook detail of Indigo sterling silver ring worn on skin",{"src":297},{},{"abstract":309,"image":310},"I live between extremes and silences, searching every day for the balance that makes everything harmonious. If you recognize it too, I'm here.",{"src":311,"alt":312,"width":116,"height":117},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Foutro-maker.jpg","Chiara Longo, Indigo's maker, closing the Whisper chapter",{"title":119,"gallery":314},[315,321,327,333,339],{"title":316,"image":317,"shopLink":320},"DANGLE EARRINGS",{"src":318,"alt":319,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Fdangle-earrings.jpg","Dangle earrings, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469841328\u002Fdangle-earrings",{"title":322,"image":323,"shopLink":326},"LAYER RING",{"src":324,"alt":325,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Flayer-ring.jpg","Layer ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466122719\u002Flayer-ring",{"title":328,"image":329,"shopLink":332},"LIBRA",{"src":330,"alt":331,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Flibra.jpg","Libra, handcrafted sterling silver 925 jewel by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469098158\u002Flibra",{"title":334,"image":335,"shopLink":338},"PETAL EARRINGS",{"src":336,"alt":337,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Fpetal-earrings.jpg","Petal earrings, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4474024499\u002Fpetal-earrings",{"title":340,"image":341,"shopLink":344},"AXIS RING",{"src":342,"alt":343,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fgallery\u002Faxis-ring.jpg","Axis ring, handcrafted lost-wax cast sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4448240483\u002Faxis-ring",{"title":340,"price":346,"mainImage":347,"tags":350},120,{"src":348,"alt":349,"width":28,"height":164},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fring-full.jpg","Indigo Axis ring, handcrafted lost-wax cast sterling silver 925 with mirror-polished balance of two ends",[166,351,258,169],"Lost wax casting",{"story":353,"crafting":354},"The design draws inspiration from the search for both inner and everyday balance. Two opposing ends — one flat, the other inclined — engage in a dialogue between stability and tension. A balance never final, always on the verge of shifting, embodying the constant oscillation that defines life itself.","Handcrafted through the lost-wax casting technique, the ring reveals clean, decisive lines with a bold presence. Its smooth, uniform surface enhances the geometry and the sharp contrast between its two ends, while the adjustable opening makes it versatile and effortless to wear.","whisper",{"bg":357,"song":359},{"src":358},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fsounds\u002Fwhisper-ambient.mp3",{"src":360},"\u002Fchapters\u002F03_whisper\u002Fsounds\u002Fwhisper-song.mp3","chapters\u002F03_whisper","AC0TxlJ1hVW3qVIke13M0h-Y5jvhuQTERhqdcwNUxvg",{"id":364,"title":365,"caption":366,"cover":367,"extension":6,"head":375,"lookbook":390,"meta":399,"outro":400,"productGallery":405,"productOverview":432,"productStory":438,"slug":441,"sounds":442,"stem":447,"__hash__":448},"chapters\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance.json","Resonance","EVERY CRACK IS RESONANCE, EVERY MARK A MEMORY",{"alt":368,"desktop":369,"mobile":371,"thumbnail":373},"Resonance chapter cover: Indigo handcrafted oxidized sterling silver jewelry inspired by erosion and memory",{"src":370,"width":28,"height":74},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fcover-desktop.jpg",{"src":372,"width":32,"height":28},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fcover-mobile.jpg",{"src":374,"width":79,"height":79},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fthumbnail.jpg",{"abstract":376,"heading1":377,"heading2":378,"sideImage1":379,"sideImage2":382,"mainImage":385,"cursorImage":388},"The echo multiplies, silence takes shape. Luminous forms intertwine into precious energy to be worn.","DEEP","RESONANCE",{"src":380,"alt":381,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-1.jpg","Editorial detail of Indigo Resonance sterling silver jewelry, luminous forms of precious energy",{"src":383,"alt":384,"width":87,"height":88},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-2.jpg","Model wearing handcrafted Indigo silver jewelry from the deep Resonance tale",{"src":386,"alt":387,"width":95,"height":96},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fhead-main.jpg","Indigo Rock silver ring styled in the deep Resonance editorial",{"src":389},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fring-float-240x240.webp",{"abstract":391,"mainImage":392,"secondaryImage":395,"cursorImage":398},"I live the city's echo, between neon and concrete. I seek an aesthetic that multiplies reflections and depth, capable of giving vibrations back to every surface. Every mark is resonance, every form a fragment of the Berlin night.",{"src":393,"alt":394,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Flookbook-main.jpg","Resonance lookbook: Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry echoing the Berlin night between neon and concrete",{"src":396,"alt":397,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg","Resonance lookbook detail of Indigo oxidized sterling silver ring worn on skin",{"src":389},{},{"abstract":401,"image":402},"Imperfection is the truest mark of who we are, like rock shaped by time: fragile on the surface, yet strong within. If this speaks to you, reach out to me.",{"src":403,"alt":404,"width":116,"height":117},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Foutro-maker.jpg","Chiara Longo, Indigo's maker, closing the Resonance chapter",{"title":119,"gallery":406},[407,411,417,423,426],{"title":340,"image":408,"shopLink":344},{"src":409,"alt":410,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F04_resonance\u002Fgallery\u002Faxis-ring.jpg","Axis ring, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo",{"title":412,"image":413,"shopLink":416},"ROCK RING",{"src":414,"alt":