restrained depth. An aesthetic born from invisible currents, from submerged vibrations resurfacing at the surface. Every trace is mystery, every form a silence that turns into a sign.",{"src":479,"alt":480,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Flookbook-main.jpg","Sub-noise lookbook: Indigo handcrafted silver jewelry born from the sea's invisible currents",{"src":482,"alt":483,"width":104,"height":105},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Flookbook-secondary.jpg","Sub-noise lookbook detail of Indigo oxidized sterling silver ring worn on skin",{"src":475},{},{"abstract":487,"image":488},"In silence I find calm and listen to what words cannot tell. The sea is a place that has inspired meif you feel the same, reach out to me.",{"src":489,"alt":490,"width":116,"height":117},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Foutro-maker.jpg","Chiara Longo, Indigo's maker, closing the Sub-noise chapter",{"title":119,"gallery":492},[493,499,505,511,517],{"title":494,"image":495,"shopLink":498},"CAGE EAR CUFF",{"src":496,"alt":497,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fcage-ear-cuff.jpg","Cage ear cuff, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469823121\u002Fcage-ear-cuff",{"title":500,"image":501,"shopLink":504},"CORAL",{"src":502,"alt":503,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fcoral.jpg","Coral, handcrafted sterling silver 925 jewel by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4469085870\u002Fcoral",{"title":506,"image":507,"shopLink":510},"UNDERTOW RING",{"src":508,"alt":509,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fundertow-ring.jpg","Undertow ring, handcrafted oxidized sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4466070681\u002Fundertow-ring",{"title":512,"image":513,"shopLink":516},"ISLAND EARRINGS",{"src":514,"alt":515,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fisland-earrings.jpg","Island earrings, handcrafted sterling silver 925 by Indigo","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.etsy.com\u002Fit\u002Flisting\u002F4474029668\u002Fisland-earrings",{"title":154,"image":518,"shopLink":158},{"src":519,"alt":157,"width":126,"height":127},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fgallery\u002Fchains-ring.jpg",{"title":506,"price":252,"mainImage":521,"tags":524},{"src":522,"alt":523,"width":28,"height":164},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fring-full.jpg","Indigo Undertow ring, handcrafted lost-wax cast sterling silver 925 with oxidized seaweed-inspired form",[166,257,525,169],"Oxidized surface with polished details",{"story":527,"crafting":528},"This ring was born from the desire to capture the slow movement of seaweed beneath the surface — their silent, vertical sway in a world where time seems suspended. It embodies the deep calm and slowness we often lose today, that fleeting breath we can only sense underwater, in a silence that restores and envelops.","Ring handcrafted using the lost-wax casting technique. The open, adjustable band has been oxidized to emphasize its depth and detail. The design is inspired by seaweed, climbing the finger as if defying gravity, with vertical and irregular forms that evoke the fluid, organic movement of the ocean floor.","sub-noise",{"bg":531,"song":533},{"src":532},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fsounds\u002Fsubnoise-ambient.mp3",{"src":534},"\u002Fchapters\u002F05_subnoise\u002Fsounds\u002Fsubnoise-song.mp3","chapters\u002F05_subnoise","1AF9IVRzPQ7jqr8X-Ph22-RtZoWADhASpbJ7SmVJ0LA",{"id":538,"title":539,"abstract":540,"extension":6,"image":541,"meta":546,"stem":547,"__hash__":548},"contactsModal\u002Fmodals\u002Fcontacts.json","YOUR STORY, YOUR JEWEL.!","If what you’ve seen speaks to you, let’s create something that tells your story. Write to me: your unique jewel can start here.",{"src":542,"alt":543,"width":544,"height":5